00:18:10.770 --> 00:18:12.330
<i>I don't resent you anymore.</i>

00:18:12.740 --> 00:18:15.240
<i>It was more than a year ago.</i>

00:18:15.240 --> 00:18:17.190
<i>I'm at the Inter-High.</i>

00:18:17.670 --> 00:18:19.490
<i>From the bottom of my heart...</i>

00:18:21.610 --> 00:18:23.400
Good job, Manami!

00:18:23.400 --> 00:18:26.080
Hakone's Kuroda is moving to the front!

00:18:26.610 --> 00:18:28.710
We were watching your final moments.

00:18:28.710 --> 00:18:30.210
Thanks.

00:18:31.290 --> 00:18:31.960
Huh?

00:18:31.960 --> 00:18:34.500
You weren't watching!

00:18:34.500 --> 00:18:35.930
You were in the back!

00:18:36.570 --> 00:18:39.400
I was just trying to say something 
appropriate for a senior.

00:18:39.400 --> 00:18:41.090
Don't lie about it.

00:18:41.090 --> 00:18:43.370
Since you're so tall, it almost sounded true.

00:18:43.370 --> 00:18:45.910
Not even I could see over the team.

00:18:45.910 --> 00:18:47.550
Knock off the "ha ha ha"!

00:18:47.550 --> 00:18:49.020
What?

00:18:58.360 --> 00:19:00.240
Keep going, Naruko-kun!

00:19:00.240 --> 00:19:02.030
I'll take Teshima-san to the finish line!

00:19:02.400 --> 00:19:04.740
I was already planning on it.

00:19:04.740 --> 00:19:07.790
Anyway, you made it, Onoda-kun.

00:19:08.130 --> 00:19:09.160
Yeah.

00:19:09.650 --> 00:19:11.170
Good job!

00:19:11.570 --> 00:19:12.420
Teshima-san!

00:19:18.930 --> 00:19:20.800
Hey, Ima...

00:19:21.130 --> 00:19:22.840
Good work!

00:19:27.780 --> 00:19:30.070
Teshima-san was exhausted.

00:19:30.070 --> 00:19:30.850
Yeah.

00:19:31.400 --> 00:19:34.560
Exhausted like a man 
who's fought really hard.

00:19:34.900 --> 00:19:38.870
Naruko, I thought we were going to catch up.

00:19:38.870 --> 00:19:41.260
Hakone Academy's pulling away.

00:19:41.260 --> 00:19:42.330
What are you doing?

00:19:42.330 --> 00:19:43.600
Shut up, idiot!

00:19:43.600 --> 00:19:46.850
It's more exciting if it's close!
 I'm doing it on purpose!

00:19:46.850 --> 00:19:49.540
I let my guard down a bit on the last turn.

00:19:49.540 --> 00:19:51.710
I was 0.5 seconds slow to react.

00:19:51.710 --> 00:19:53.290
Yeah, because you were talking.

00:19:53.290 --> 00:19:55.250
You were talking, too.

00:19:56.600 --> 00:19:58.210
You just watch, hotshot.

00:19:58.210 --> 00:20:01.190
<i>Naruko the Movie</i> is nothing if not flashy.

00:20:01.190 --> 00:20:05.430
How could I not be fired up after
 the way Teshima-san showed off?

00:20:05.930 --> 00:20:08.180
You don't need to pay admission, Teshima-san.

00:20:08.180 --> 00:20:10.430
I'll have my own fun.

00:20:10.430 --> 00:20:13.890
You just watch from your box seat!

00:20:19.750 --> 00:20:22.780
Wait up, Hakone Academy!

00:20:23.780 --> 00:20:24.780
<i>They caught up?</i>

00:20:25.450 --> 00:20:27.780
<i>Now, just as we've moved to the front?</i>

00:20:27.780 --> 00:20:33.790
<i>But he doesn't stand a chance 
against my Cat Leg muscles.</i>

00:20:34.500 --> 00:20:38.500
Let's see who this year's 
champions are, Sohoku.

00:20:48.230 --> 00:20:49.850
Muscles?

00:20:55.700 --> 00:20:59.240
Did someone say "muscles"?

00:22:31.870 --> 00:22:34.870
<b>Hakone Academy Bicycle Racing Club</b>

00:22:33.250 --> 00:22:41.500
Scrub, scrub, scrub, scrub, scrub...

00:22:41.500 --> 00:22:44.860
Hey, Manami's still not here.

00:22:44.860 --> 00:22:47.130
Has he forgotten about cleaning?

00:22:47.130 --> 00:22:51.910
He's never done it.
 Not even when he was a first-year!

00:22:51.910 --> 00:22:55.520
Arakita-san and Toudou-san 
are too easy on him.

00:22:55.870 --> 00:22:57.990
We must correct his behavior 
in our generation.

00:22:59.230 --> 00:23:01.690
Good morning.

00:23:02.440 --> 00:23:04.260
You're late, Manami!

00:23:04.260 --> 00:23:05.190
Stop being late!

00:23:05.190 --> 00:23:06.700
Late?

00:23:06.700 --> 00:23:09.540
Oh. Look, Kuroda-san.

00:23:09.540 --> 00:23:11.510
I brought something special.

00:23:13.530 --> 00:23:15.950
Scrub, scrub...

00:23:15.950 --> 00:23:18.330
Manami Sangaku Attendance

