<b>Late</b>

00:23:15.950 --> 00:23:18.330
<b>Late</b>

00:23:15.950 --> 00:23:18.330
<b>Late</b>

00:23:16.330 --> 00:23:17.690
Ta-dah!

00:23:18.730 --> 00:23:21.220
M-Manami, you...

00:23:21.800 --> 00:23:24.230
were late less than ten times this month!

00:23:24.230 --> 00:23:26.590
I knew you could do it.

00:23:26.590 --> 00:23:29.300
Wow, you've been waking up early.

00:23:30.230 --> 00:23:31.090
Scrub!

00:23:33.260 --> 00:23:36.390
I refuse to accept this!

